            "text": "theorem totient_mul_norm_le {q : ℕ} [NeZero q] {a : ℕ → ℂ}\n    (ha : Summable fun n => ‖a n‖) (hcop : ∀ n, a n ≠ 0 → Nat.Coprime n q) (β : ℝ)\n    {b : ZMod q} (hb : IsUnit b) :\n    q.totient * ‖expTsum a ((b.val : ℝ) / q + β)‖ ≤\n      ∑ ψ : DirichletCharacter ℂ q, ‖gaussSum ψ ZMod.stdAddChar‖ * ‖Schar ψ⁻¹ a β‖ :=",
